sequenceDiagram
  participant BA as Browser A
  participant A as Peer daemon A
  participant T as Tracker
  participant B as Peer daemon B
  Note over A,T: start-up and every 10 s (heartbeat)
  A->>T: POST /submit-info {peer_id, host, port, udp_port}
  T-->>A: 200 {token, peers}
  BA->>A: POST /login {username, password}
  A->>T: POST /login {peer_id, token, username, password}
  Note over T: PBKDF2 password check,<br/>record user on peer1
  T-->>A: 200 {ok}
  A-->>BA: 200 + Set-Cookie session_peer1 (HttpOnly)
  BA->>A: GET /api/peers (cookie)
  A->>T: GET /get-list
  T-->>A: [{peer_id, username, host, port, udp_port}, ...]
  A-->>BA: peers + connected flags
  BA->>A: POST /connect-peer {peer_id: peer2}
  A->>B: TCP connect, frame CONNECT {peer_id, username}
  Note left of B: mark peer1<br/>connected
  B-->>A: frame CONNECT_OK {peer_id, username}
  A-->>BA: 200 {connection}
